Package: afmf-linux
Architecture: amd64
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libvulkan1
Description: AMD Fluid Motion Frames for Linux - Vulkan frame generation layer
 An open-source equivalent of AMD Fluid Motion Frames (AFMF): a Vulkan
 implicit layer that generates one interpolated frame between every two
 frames a game presents, from the colour buffer alone, using FidelityFX
 Optical Flow. Works with any 64-bit Vulkan application, including DXVK
 and vkd3d-proton titles under Proton. Dormant until AFMF_ENABLE=1 is set
 for a game.
